om school. She walks to school with Taiyo whenever he attends, and even tries to give him her hand-knitted gloves, showing that she really likes him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Wikipedia"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Makes a special appearance in the PSP release of Kamaitachi no Yoru 2 ~Kangokujima no Warabe Uta~ as a part-time maid."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c136000"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4e61754e5761bfee094f5a1d9eea41a51f269c321c7c468d13c6bd673ab11d3c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/7495570e0a226aace479a5c69c59975f5b75f782e870c3b8f00b4a4631add35a.webp","width":168,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"谷井 あすか","creatorId":"vndb:s657","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s657","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s657","name":"谷井 あすか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:30518","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c136071","characterName":"中島 ヒカル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c136071"},"originalCharacterName":"中島 ヒカル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"14"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1210"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Born on December 10, 1989. Sagittarius. Blood type is O. Member of the Shogi Club. Her hobby is cooking and attending festivals."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the girls' class representative. She has distinctive red-rimmed glasses and pigtails. She is a caring and reliable person who worries and shows concern when so